---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Methodology — Stable or Gone">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="panel hero-main">
      <div class="prompt">&gt; open methodology</div>
      <h1>Methodology</h1>
      <p>SOG records stablecoin history with source-backed notes, conservative status labels, visible uncertainty, and separate event records.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-grid">
    <div class="panel mini-card"><h2>Status</h2><p>Status labels describe registry state. Event records describe what happened.</p></div>
    <div class="panel mini-card"><h2>Events</h2><p>Material events are kept separate from stablecoin status to avoid overstatement.</p></div>
    <div class="panel mini-card"><h2>Sources</h2><p>Claims should be backed by public sources where possible.</p></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
